  - pageLabel: Scene 1
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 2074956067}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1772043988}
    titleContent: Guide
    textComponent: {fileID: 1562095088}
    textContent: This signal usually comes from a wingwalker standing right at the
      wingtip not always the head marshaller because that's the only person who can
      actually see if the tip will clear an obstacle.
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c687426ddbde1c94a82dc3590bd2d7b8, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: right hand up, left hand down. Which signal did you just see?
      options:
      - optionText: "Guide \n\n"
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: ' Identify Gate'
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: ' Normal Stop'
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Chocks Inserted
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 851805789}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 2
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 2074956067}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1772043988}
    titleContent: 'Identify Gate '
    textComponent: {fileID: 1562095088}
    textContent: "On a busy apron with several marshallers working at once, this
      is the signal that cuts through the noise and says \u201Cover here.\u201D"
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a39023898a9e48944b686ebb3383edab, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: ' Both arms fully extended straight up, wands pointing to the
        sky. Which signal did you just see?'
      options:
      - optionText: "Guide \n\n"
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: ' Normal Stop'
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Chocks Out
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: ' Identify Gate'
        isCorrect: 1
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 851805789}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 3
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 2074956067}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1772043988}
    titleContent: 'Turn Left '
    textComponent: {fileID: 1562095088}
    textContent: "\u201CLeft\u201D and \u201Cright\u201D in these signals are always
      described from the pilot's point of view, not the signalman's  worth calling
      out clearly on screen so learners don't mirror it by mistake."
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5202eaf462def0458822ed9b21c49ea, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: ' Both arms fully extended straight up, wands pointing to the
        sky. Which signal did you just see?'
      options:
      - optionText: 'Straight Ahead '
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Turn Left
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: Turn Right
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Normal Stop
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 851805789}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
